    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule clients' social posts from Google Sheets and track what went live\n\n### How it works\nFor agencies that plan clients' posts in a shared sheet. Every 15 minutes the workflow reads the rows whose Status is **Ready**, finds the client's profile in Rizamo by name and its accounts by network, and schedules the post at the row's date and time with its images or video. The row turns **Scheduled**, with the post's ID, or shows why it could not be scheduled.\n\nWhen every network of a post is done, Rizamo starts the second part, which writes **Published** and each network's link in the row, or what failed and why. A failure also goes to Slack, to fix before the client sees it.\n\n### The sheet\nColumns: **Client** (the profile's name in Rizamo), **Networks** (such as Instagram, Facebook; empty for every account), **Text**, **Media URLs** (public links separated by commas, may be empty), **Publish at** (such as 2026-12-01 09:00, in the profile's time zone), **Status**, **Post ID** and **Links**.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified community node `@rizamohq/n8n-nodes-rizamo` (tested with 0.1.1): open the nodes panel, search **Rizamo** and choose **Install** ([installation guide](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/community-nodes/installation/verified-install/)).\n2. In Rizamo, open **Developers**, create an API key and add it in n8n as a **Rizamo API** credential.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and pick your sheet in **Read rows**, **Mark scheduled**, **Mark failed**, **Find the row** and **Update the row**.\n4. Connect Slack and pick a channel in **Alert the account manager**.\n5. Activate the workflow. **Post published or failed** creates its webhook in Rizamo, which needs an https address: n8n Cloud has one, and a self-hosted n8n needs a public one.\n\n### Customization\nChange the interval in **Every 15 minutes**, or set When to Save as Draft in **Schedule post** for posts a client approves in Rizamo first.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "027e9213-3c4d-5966-bfe2-f2c8ec3ac147",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -280
      ]
